  "body": "PR to add a new documentation page describing how to extend the HEALPix pixelation to an ellipsoid.\r\n\r\n### What's included\r\n- `ellipsoidal-extension.md`: explains the area-preserving transformation from ellipsoid to authalic sphere.\r\n- `elliposid_schema.png`: illustration of the mapping process.\r\n- Link to the new page added in `docs/healpix/index.md`.\r\n\r\n### Motivation\r\nStandard HEALPix assumes a spherical Earth. This extension enables its use on ellipsoidal models (e.g., WGS84) while preserving its key properties: equal area, isolatitude, and hierarchy.\r\n\r\n### TODO\r\n- add a link to `ellipsoidal-extension.md` in `docs/healpix/reference-system.md` when added to the doc. \r\n\r\n@keewis feel free to review!",
